{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/move_puzzle_to_battle640.gif?t=1743600157\" />Merge and Blade is a fantasy puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will engage in large-scale battles with monsters with your own squad which is made using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a battle, you can recruit new units using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By proceeding with these puzzles and battles, you will retake the castles occupied by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/world640.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you retake the castle one by one, your base and squad get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey will continue until retaking the last castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But, even if you retake the last castle, your journey won't completely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are endless invading monsters that you have to hold off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can battle with your friends or can save the world again with another strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to save this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title1.png?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title2.png?t=1743600157\" />This game is a puzzle that builds blocks that come down like Tetris, Hexa, and Puyo Puyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it's not about holding out for a long time or removing blocks. it's about merging the same three or more units to create a higher class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/combo640.gif?t=1743600157\" />The goal of the puzzle is to create a squad as strong as possible within a limited turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can make a much stronger squad or can get additional turns with multi-merge, combo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title3.png?t=1743600157\" />Battles are performed in real-time up to 25 v 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/battle640.gif?t=1743600157\" />In battles, formation is important, as well as each unit's stats. This is because each unit has its own attack types and attack or heal ranges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So it's good to care about the position of the unit when you place units in the puzzle part. In addition, you can use swaps to change their position in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/move_battle_to_puzzle640.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title4.png?t=1743600157\" />You can use gold from puzzles and battles to upgrade your base and units in your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base upgrades provide unlocking the merging list and adding the number of turns, previews, and swap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units upgrades increase the unit's HP and ATK, giving you an advantage in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/640x320_5.png?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title7.png?t=1743600157\" />Survive from the endless monsters as long as you can with your squad you've grown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title8.png?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2p640.gif?t=1743600157\" />Brag your puzzle skill in this local multi-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even play with your friends who don't have the game using Steam remote play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title9.png?t=1743600157\" />It's another land only for the challenge mode. Make a new squad, and complete from start to finish at one go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title6.png?t=1743600157\" />You can compete with other players with the defense mode score, etc.<br><br><strong>Updated Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Roguelike Mode</strong>: Use various characters to explore and grow, experiencing something new every time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Golem Factory: Defeat golems hatched by fanatics in this challenging mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night of Reckoning: Launch a surprise attack on a lich\u2019s castle in a 15-round puzzle-based showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mithril Mines: Mine mithril ore to gather vast resources in this resource-focused mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Into the Darkness: Explore an endless underground dungeon with no known end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Roguelite Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 100-stage roguelite mode with 10\u201330 rounds per stage. Use crystals earned in-game to upgrade characters, units, and facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Suppression Mode</strong>: Real-Time Battle Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebellion Suppression Mode: A 10-stage arcade-style real-time puzzle battle campaign to crush rebellions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punishment Mode: A survivor mode aiming to break stage records, challenging you to punish endless waves of traitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_berserker.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_card_master.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_dictator.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_explorer.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_prophet.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_puppy.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_thief.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/elf_archer.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_bishop.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_revolutionist.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_vampire.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Saver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/b604204347a3cb4a7dc0db4578faf3aa99998049.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/183b238a49c485d2f8c10d08bcebf61ecb2e4b36.jpg"},{"name":"Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/f08f29932a5b550ea5b10cd801b0408352881917.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/e968a32171282fddfd111d866c37295664547e12.jpg"},{"name":"Merge Mania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/679467cc2e925bb7d6091e63e91cbeb5fa68af31.jpg"},{"name":"Merge Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/3466e5c186967423c39e3dfbd1007521a813232f.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Mania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/56ba0fdaecac0fdaeddee92d79e27ad5801965ed.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/710f34a7d3c2705e98a1861c89b41525768fbfac.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/142487a8b262a0c3fc443133852f7386f45d5f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Ork Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/ff1af57e987927301ec056b172d1635f6bc96432.jpg"}],"total":78},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1446930?t=1743600157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743600157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743600157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743600157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1488880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/move_puzzle_to_battle640.gif?t=1743600157\" />Merge and Blade is a fantasy puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will engage in large-scale battles with monsters with your own squad which is made using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a battle, you can recruit new units using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By proceeding with these puzzles and battles, you will retake the castles occupied by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/world640.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you retake the castle one by one, your base and squad get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey will continue until retaking the last castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But, even if you retake the last castle, your journey won't completely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are endless invading monsters that you have to hold off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can battle with your friends or can save the world again with another strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to save this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title1.png?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title2.png?t=1743600157\" />This game is a puzzle that builds blocks that come down like Tetris, Hexa, and Puyo Puyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it's not about holding out for a long time or removing blocks. it's about merging the same three or more units to create a higher class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/combo640.gif?t=1743600157\" />The goal of the puzzle is to create a squad as strong as possible within a limited turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can make a much stronger squad or can get additional turns with multi-merge, combo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title3.png?t=1743600157\" />Battles are performed in real-time up to 25 v 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/battle640.gif?t=1743600157\" />In battles, formation is important, as well as each unit's stats. This is because each unit has its own attack types and attack or heal ranges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So it's good to care about the position of the unit when you place units in the puzzle part. In addition, you can use swaps to change their position in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/move_battle_to_puzzle640.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title4.png?t=1743600157\" />You can use gold from puzzles and battles to upgrade your base and units in your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base upgrades provide unlocking the merging list and adding the number of turns, previews, and swap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units upgrades increase the unit's HP and ATK, giving you an advantage in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/640x320_5.png?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title7.png?t=1743600157\" />Survive from the endless monsters as long as you can with your squad you've grown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title8.png?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2p640.gif?t=1743600157\" />Brag your puzzle skill in this local multi-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can even play with your friends who don't have the game using Steam remote play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title9.png?t=1743600157\" />It's another land only for the challenge mode. Make a new squad, and complete from start to finish at one go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/title6.png?t=1743600157\" />You can compete with other players with the defense mode score, etc.<br><br><strong>Updated Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Roguelike Mode</strong>: Use various characters to explore and grow, experiencing something new every time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Golem Factory: Defeat golems hatched by fanatics in this challenging mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night of Reckoning: Launch a surprise attack on a lich\u2019s castle in a 15-round puzzle-based showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mithril Mines: Mine mithril ore to gather vast resources in this resource-focused mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Into the Darkness: Explore an endless underground dungeon with no known end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Roguelite Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 100-stage roguelite mode with 10\u201330 rounds per stage. Use crystals earned in-game to upgrade characters, units, and facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 <strong>Suppression Mode</strong>: Real-Time Battle Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebellion Suppression Mode: A 10-stage arcade-style real-time puzzle battle campaign to crush rebellions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punishment Mode: A survivor mode aiming to break stage records, challenging you to punish endless waves of traitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_berserker.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_card_master.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_dictator.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_explorer.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_prophet.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_puppy.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC_reveal_thief.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/elf_archer.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_bishop.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_revolutionist.gif?t=1743600157\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/DLC2reveal_vampire.gif?t=1743600157\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Magic Cube"],"dlc":[2327290,2381120,2381121,2381130],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{